  "details": "Hi,\n\nI own quite a few avatars and upload them to VRChat. With this background, I would like to play with the main avatar (the 1st avatar) and another avatar (the 2nd avatar) as an NPC partner. The best request is for this NPC partner to be global, but since it would result in an increase in load, we would like it to be displayed locally. I would like this NPC partner to be able to take pictures with his own camera. By using the remaining avatars, we hope to create a rich play environment in VRChat.\n\nThank you in advance.",
